    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Want to raise strong Pokémon\n",
        "but have no clue which one to pick...?\r",
        "For those Trainers who feel this way,\n",
        "the Battle Factory is truly a place\f",
        "worth visiting!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "You are quite right.\r",
        "They say life is an endless series of\n",
        "learning opportunities.\r",
        "This place is the best for learning\n",
        "about Pokémon battles and about\f",
        "other Trainers..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Aaaaand--bam!\n",
        "Aaaaaaaaaand--bam!\r",
        "I don’t have Pokémon yet, so I’m\n",
        "practicing throwing Poké Balls!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Grandma, yoo-hoo! Grandma!\n",
        "I’ve come to trade Accessories!\f",
        "I’ve got somethin’ just for my grandma!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, thank you, my dear...\r",
        "You’re so cute and strong and nice...\n",
        "I’m lucky to have a grandchild like you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "That little girl over there with\n",
        "her grandma...\r",
        "I happen to know that little girl is\n",
        "incredibly strong...\r",
        "Looks can sometimes be deceiving.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "One Trainer should select\n",
        "“BECOME LEADER.”\r",
        "The other Trainer must select\n",
        "“JOIN GROUP.”{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "We need to launch DS Wireless\n",
        "Communications.{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "You must save the game before I\n",
        "show you in. Please wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "Please choose the Pokémon you wish\n",
        "to enter.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "There is an ongoing winning streak\n",
        "saved for {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Delete this record and start a new\n",
        "challenge with {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}?{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\r",
        "You don’t have a single eligible Pokémon\n",
        "of at least Lv. 30!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\r",
        "For Double Battles, you must have two\n",
        "of the same kind of Pokémon that are\f",
        "at least Lv. 30 each.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00037",
      "en_US": "Also, Eggs are ineligible to enter.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00038",
