    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00056",
      "en_US": "Please come see me when you are ready.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "The Battle Hall Multi Battle challenge\n",
        "requires both partners to enter the\f",
        "same kind of Pokémon.\r",
        "Please confer with your friend and\n",
        "choose the same kind of Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00058",
      "en_US": "CHALLENGE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00059",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you eat your favorite dish first or\n",
        "leave it for later?\r",
        "At the Battle Hall, it’s better to start\n",
        "with the types that your Pokémon\f",
        "do not like. Why?\r",
        "Because the opposition goes up in\n",
        "level as you progress!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "That opulent stage!\r",
        "Your streaks of winnings are kept per\n",
        "each kind of Pokémon.\f",
        "Every Pokémon can get up there.\r",
        "Don’t you think it’s wonderful\n",
        "you can aim for the top with\f",
        "any Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00061",
      "en_US": [
        "Slow...\r",
        "My SLOWBRO is a cutie, but he’s even\n",
        "battled the Brain here.\r",
        "The Brain will take your Pokémon on at\n",
        "the same level, to be fair."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00062",
      "en_US": "SLOWBRO: ...Slow?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00063",
      "en_US": [
        "Here is a tip!\r",
        "You should try the Battle Hall with\n",
        "not just your favorite Pokémon,\r",
        "but different kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "if you want to build your\f",
        "overall record as well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00064",
      "en_US": [
        "At the Battle Hall, if it’s the same kind\n",
        "of Pokémon, you can enter different\f",
        "ones and still keep your record.\r",
        "You may want to have different ones\n",
        "knowing different types of moves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00065",
      "en_US": [
        "You know how HOPPIP has two types--\n",
        "Grass and Flying?\r",
        "That means it can appear as a\n",
        "Grass type and as a Flying type.\r",
        "Me?\r",
        "You could think of me as...\n",
        "a “Lighthearted” type and\f",
        "a “Beautiful” type, I guess."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00066",
      "en_US": [
        "A piece of advice...\r",
        "At the Battle Hall, the opposing\n",
        "Pokémon are matched in level to yours.\r",
        "That way, you can choose any of your\n",
        "Pokémon without worrying about\f",
        "their levels."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00067",
      "en_US": [
        "The Battle Hall lets you keep the\n",
        "winning-streak records.\f",
        "That’s neat, huh?\r",
        "...Wait a sec!\r",
        "My friend and I can start challenges\n",
        "with identical conditions and see who\f",
        "can stretch their win streak\f",
        "the longest.\f",
        "That’s even more fun!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00068",
      "en_US": [
        "I keep track of the total number of\n",
        "wins from your longest Single Battle\f",
        "win streaks at the Battle Hall.\r",
        "To explain, I add only the longest win\n",
        "streaks of each kind of Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0108_D32R0401_00069",
      "en_US": [
        "When your total win-streak record hits\n",
        "certain figures, you will earn BP as\f",
        "a reward.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\n",
        "record is presently {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0}.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
